#: scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f69dbf22ce9557bc4fdfc0c3beeb4224161c096650f14fa0b6e76a7bd9611cd5
#. default-sha256: 7a51680c8dc8f3c7174592fc765ba7744bf006a649397a57ca676a7b7c3d768d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Je venais d’avoir quatorze "
"printemps."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c55a6475ae15a47f2a32d331a1627b6f3dc2c39d8658b24e0b9681ab2dea6988
#. default-sha256: 17393f948720f9936bab14d34d7de3d277bbda40f1dcb9c42e1a92480fdaf3fc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En ce qui me concernait, je préférais quand le soleil n’était pas de sortie.⟪k:1⟫ La lumière "
"n’allait pas me tuer à proprement parler,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e8426b3fb8a1578e641349223970df3476bf9b364a3b13fd9e89becdebfa43c
#. default-sha256: f0bc0989ae2d0d8542a84e401c51be7c8fd68f8b44f887799993b4e31bc84c14
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mais si elle était trop soutenue, le monde qui m’entourait devenait si éclatant que je n’y "
"voyais plus rien du tout."

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ba586dff0e772ec7db9a7d29d14f20d2e831fdff4870389f81bec828f2c0a4f
#. default-sha256: 274d792839004718b3e0d32b5f25276dcac297c1bf08fb3411316b6897d357f7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As I was meandering through the courtyard,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Alors que je déambulais dans le jardin,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 092707ca1ad2a090616e2f07c217d7d9415a5afd0b505eb14dd6ce7435e41e58
#. default-sha256: a75ba20fd196cafc228505eac228427a3d3839857dcca6baeb0d3977c1426cba
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I spotted someone I had never seen before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫j’aperçus quelqu’un que je n’avais jamais vu auparavant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad91da41d7049732841e61d7903c61e7daec8945dc554301f1a4a263a1b05705
#. default-sha256: 67f0609548a14eb3a03d9cb707a4cf3fc160aff3cd3f2b88c7adcc9a19da6e4c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Who are you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Qui êtes-vous ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b734e069b855dd0e10dc78d8364995663653e5b91506ab1fa08c5d4b3365fe6
#. default-sha256: 8c9d6bfa0b086a7c682a0acd9e22f797d545c5180ecab3949368c970fed09f8a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I asked bluntly, and the girl twirled around, smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Demandai-je de but en blanc, et la fille se retourna vers moi en souriant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 963e2d0a301f4ecf9ad05bd0aaee3396727a579368d0176cfc665b64b5778eff
#. default-sha256: 1a75f5321be3d3c2a7199ffb332adc92786bfffbc4c92a0109421e9924342a16
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My apologies. You just have such a beautiful courtyard here I let myself in for a "
"little walk."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Veuillez m’excuser. Vous avez un si beau jardin, je n’ai pu m’empêcher d’y faire "
"quelques pas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53d7316403e1b7c06fb5c70c60aba3476f033efffc4b57eccfdc178d1eb44b53
#. default-sha256: 45fcd085e868137d57586d87dc15d1e1a6c03185f3cc5d946cbdcdcd1087b036
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Long, chestnut hair flowed over round, feminine shoulders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It swayed slightly in "
"the wind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De longs cheveux noisette encadraient gracieusement son visage et ses épaules délicates."
"⟪k:1⟫ Ils se balançaient au gré du vent."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edf60f4a3763f973942f089538c6962457b137cb5b62c9af9b0b0b2492910b23
#. default-sha256: 2a62360b4d13483ab2ffaba5c159a42a656dbddcfd318f8044d6bc87fd2735c3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cloud of melancholy dissipated in the light of her smile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Son sourire lumineux dissipa la morosité ambiante."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0865d19cee0b66c5b52bc51a9d19f6339ac52a48f924b512ea557426f65b71bb
#. default-sha256: f69f539caa7825c99f66e7efcdc46d5d18149d5fb73eb2a12fbd5f9f519f1e34
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re just as pretty as I heard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous devez être Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vous êtes aussi jolie qu’on le dit."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f07cb41d761c1273767805050b39fb20655a6704723ceac42e544f17baf6cfef
#. default-sha256: 95e05fe0644ce5c5912833dc73d704380198e6e586898b57d72556a1d798e698
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Finally” meet me? What was she talking about?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I stood there, baffled by this "
"strange woman,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Enfin » ? Mais de quoi parlait-elle ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tandis que je restai interdite, déconcertée "
"par cette étrange femme,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed969df0292c2b9128f7584a5dc7ddc8f261a53ba400c4567d84ddca166a92cc
#. default-sha256: 5dc271d9a7e2a161d0dec7404067a446bd8fc653bc10ca2e7db3c4b8f730da11
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m thrilled to make your acquaintance, Michelle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je suis ravie de faire votre connaissance, Michelle."

#: scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7332e95f75a6d574216d9287017f00a49d45fcddeb9aff1716546e08b9d959f
#. default-sha256: 9c0293bfed865bdc712c9e0bb63e133cd227b46cacdb5e47966cbb1081ff3bcb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like someone pouring honey into my ear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sa voix était comme du miel qui coulait dans mon oreille."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a15e1a5a4f5394313022eef6262538e25986d2b7877ae349e0d53cb084035381
#. default-sha256: 8c28088b6127140556b2144202ef95fac20548e3fb8660bbcfb8d22096166d6b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stuck another needle into my chest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫de remuer le couteau dans ma poitrine."

#: scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 721af63b3371c459fd5b79bd5b6bb5d476e18cb4c4a79bfa74986a397d6d6a28
#. default-sha256: 98fc1fe140c1daadeba3ee6fd7707cf42fb1cb95ca63df8f50cf2bea882d9d07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had told me my brother was to be married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Personne ne m’avait dit que mon frère devait se marier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4872eaa185d95ce5d23a7140a698c4c9e81a88387feae12bb1c4961e5e7c2950
#. default-sha256: 2aef5866be5cc61b2ea97902f69e78908a0ee3af7b867f7cf67ce916357161df
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father Antonin looked so proud of his two boys—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didier soon to receive his "
"assignment, and Georges soon to be wed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon père Antonin avait l’air tellement fier de ses deux garçons —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ Didier qui "
"recevrait bientôt son affectation, et Georges qui allait se marier."

#: scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4af60b70c88824c4339d78d9145354784ed070b774f8fe0d8aa7f48a1f074dfc
#. default-sha256: 17e581580286f817b275b96da7bc4b0f019e4d62979d2122804509710862d497
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The banquet proceeded smoothly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le banquet se déroula sans incident."

#: scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdc2bce3090dccb4afce9f550369185f651d53fc525da063b8f12229b3313da5
#. default-sha256: 038467e9b286f0755d73f02613063c9c557e8d6b2e162409c428e335ca6c2c12
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫not a doubt in the air that we were a happy family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout laissait à penser que nous étions une famille heureuse."

#: scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16f64f290a91bc7b6fc2305cc8f966b6710976086bc742691f576254890261cc
#. default-sha256: 2c5dae810e8e08f2a0e4abd00cc5bb74e0c656d5ede2d9542cca164b2ff7b5b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But my mind was elsewhere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais mon esprit voguait ailleurs."

#: scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc8ae90bf0560b5b87916de480e0c9fcf43448fb7c00bfdc4c6ea6d8332f1713
#. default-sha256: d9d9959db80ff45cdeae656ca65e4fe9db5092061762f8667943d49b4fe179b4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I found myself unconsciously chasing Aimee with my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je me surpris à jeter des coups d’œil furtifs à Aimée, sans même m’en rendre compte."

#: scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a03a8c7272d4046ad054af5bd7660d30bd0be7be03936e259587a0b7e1d01afa
#. default-sha256: 7508b45f2d551ba2ac981011d0081d5d7e00588d73cd05e0c233a53387770b9a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Watching the way those slender fingers gripped her spoon.⟪k:1⟫Her full lips parting to allow "
"a piece of fruit in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ observer la manière dont ses doigts fins tenaient la cuillère.⟪k:3⟫Dont ses "
"lèvres pleines s’ouvraient pour croquer dans un fruit."

#: scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7733c6f77076c4f3924d6b5195a72c7425258a9446a477ba1701e4fd1ef3eba1
#. default-sha256: fcd6c71d0819523db351d9cb3586a504a850d03b747f6212d8dcc5ae3af2ffc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her deep red tongue, visible for but the briefest of moments."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sa langue d’un rouge soutenu, ne serait-ce que l’espace d’un instant."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bad712d22a51f83e4ee794a39982e4c88358ed6b145d10e71f59d8b1ccae1229
#. default-sha256: b6a17d8871bd09489dd2ebeeed7c82f828eed91643d91d50888878c6b57e4875
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way all the muscles in her face seemed to relax in bliss as sweet juices seeped into her "
"mouth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La façon dont les muscles de son visage semblaient se relâcher de contentement quand le jus "
"sucré s’écoulait dans sa bouche."

#: scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86f10d7323142ee8c6e5bc682c1736fce7fb3525b049f0c7927015da6e5bb473
#. default-sha256: 10cdf9af5850471a2c02da9163e05a59f65cab022d8aba0cdf58d122d8618c19
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way she spoke, so soft and gentle, letting each sound hang in the air just briefly "
"before intoning the next."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sa manière de parler, si douce et agréable, et l’habitude qu’elle avait de laisser planer "
"chaque syllabe dans l’air avant de prononcer la suivante."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7ae1e722ffeefce4c552e4473628c6de4840cb127b4ca90601488eac6443bd2
#. default-sha256: 9b76c0dd9812198038d4e18c44763cf9b706ee89d28174772c4e4813ec18fdb7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was distinctly feminine—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in a different way than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle était très féminine,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ sans pour autant ressembler à ma mère."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 234c1af25061277ed4b12aedab3bcc294bedc293a8fef4322fa1d2a093f1c112
#. default-sha256: 4161d2695510cde0fbc8d3fabbcff5c118d8bd4da91e42f33e27e9eed2ba55b6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, Aimee was going to be living at the Bollinger estate for some time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Apparemment, Aimée allait vivre au domaine Bollinger pendant quelques temps."

#: scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae3339548c8a281fcee20cdeb9cbecd9a90958f2025c890e4b7eb3e3d784cf09
#. default-sha256: f350fbeef92f1eeab18226064d095ed3fae348599d6e82fafcd5d94b3a049b6f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had assumed I would hate being around another girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’avais toujours supposé que je détesterais être en compagnie d’une autre fille."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F1C4B5DF_CCD9_42D9_8198_E5C7C2159996
