msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason headstrong Didier and free-spirited Georges were able to get along at all "
"was because they were brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si le têtu Didier et l’impertinent Georges étaient capables de s’entendre, c’était bien "
"seulement parce qu’ils étaient frères."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D9D7940B_0C92_4E18_8976_F773223B2ECF
