msgid "⟪k:0⟫They looked like they were appraising me, which made me sick to my stomach."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫On aurait dit qu’ils me jaugeaient, ce qui me mettait terriblement mal à l’aise."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D035805F_FEDD_4F4F_8EBE_721AB1F1600C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2e8c2db8737da7a1d9fb6cae4e316ae8de29930ddc0204146e114de776d9142
