msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCCA5D0B_1DB3_4139_B9EC_F58F1BBEEFAE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫C’mon, Michelle. Don’t tell me you forgot what to do."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais qu’est-ce que t’attends, Michelle ? Me dis pas que t’as oublié comment faire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4114e82d8f1bb8750b2a354308b58df183a76e4bc46011b8aee099d52266dbce
#. default-sha256: fc3f20efe7c3d320f93a8a10aa661ae82cdbe3e3a3ef0c3b2cd88c746d33e389
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was to present my hand to the man—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫for him to kiss."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je devais donner ma main à l’homme —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ pour qu’il y dépose un baiser."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 266c29792dde2618da748a2f5215743d34dc8c5343a8f4cbf2caf9892c6fa7c8
#. default-sha256: 450a4f15aebc7656a7bf716f31bd9408553e87d0af64fb9e286f65a12f24aaee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why? Why was ⟪k:1⟫this⟪k:2⟫ a traditional greeting?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why did I have to go through "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pourquoi ? Pourquoi fallait-il que ce soit le salut traditionnel ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pourquoi devais-"
"je subir cela ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de3495df89815f0909355ee2e6e675a6d878c53b558e825b0a11ab9754d29136
#. default-sha256: 8e6a0c6f2e575addebe42f6b9570843f4cc18736e200b9481f1538169b2ff263
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man kneeling before me gave an uncomfortable chuckle at my reluctance, shrugged, and "
"reverently took my hand in his."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’homme qui s’était agenouillé devant moi eut un petit rire gêné en voyant ma réticence, "
"haussa des épaules, et prit respectueusement ma main dans la sienne."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d47709ca21acc9f23abb80f9dcec3c856bcdd3b34b943b27716885f05df4504a
#. default-sha256: ce9720bf65a6847983b43d4b5558016e72de33017b779016a041ed2ee4d1ead3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Reflexively, I smacked the man’s hand away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Georges’s eyes went wide in horror, and "
"the man gave another playful shrug."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Par réflexe, je repoussai violemment sa main.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Les yeux de Georges s’agrandirent "
"d’horreur et l’homme haussa des épaules, narquois."

#: scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 188b27ed5744002ea96e4c59170c39c0af61006a6bdb53a60574fac874fec41c
#. default-sha256: 9f8157e1321c44e52e3a4fb3428fdd79f7cf231908b00a85e4862b69cea57063
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was half a second away from throwing a barrage of insults, but I bit my tongue and stomped "
"off instead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je dus me mordre la langue pour ne pas lui répondre en lui jetant un torrent d’insultes à la "
"figure ; je me contentai de taper du pied."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 047a0c9cfe5dcb3ff47bc672e285ee75cd76ce5ccb56c242bef5553b9628eee8
#. default-sha256: eca0d11aa645ceea8d9c0e767ec774974e7e496c92085eb82c7fb13c6cafa0d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had spent all that time convincing myself I couldn’t humiliate my brothers, but now, I "
"wouldn’t hear a word of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais passé tout mon temps à me raisonner, à me convaincre que jamais je ne pourrais "
"humilier mes frères, mais là, c’en était trop, je ne voulais rien entendre."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f79d11d5a878c3c0d4160329125c14fe984e822eaae7c201ebf2631e19a23b7
#. default-sha256: 77ca880df2420f5289134ed3beadbfbbf0d426463d314ab1b6ea51b835007c9b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say, practically swiping a glass of water off a passing waiter’s tray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Dis-je, en attrapant au vol sur le plateau d’un serveur un verre d’eau."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7aa384a41fa0422aabb229cd998850c13585bb0ae00ecde33e65039db8b73ac5
#. default-sha256: bcb4aa9a930dd29bdcd6cb6e0b8524374fafa374bd464d774856794823f6db62
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I rubbed it with my sleeve until my skin was bright red. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted to feel something "
"else—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫anything else—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫even pain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je la frottai alors contre ma manche jusqu’à ce que ma peau devienne toute rouge. ⟪k:1⟫Je "
"voulais ressentir autre chose —⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ n’importe quoi d’autre —⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ de la douleur, même."

#: scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7441495ffa6c5b87df440adfeac3fb32354762157075d2c94eec03a04f57bb1c
#. default-sha256: 0e5692d3e002809e719a5da84a4df2c74f8b47700002624747171339c2518fbe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was angry, and I had every right to be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’étais en colère, et j’avais toutes les raisons de l’être."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3004a574a7a849524eca61a814173c8781f54d03370b460a43eba98a04892eb
#. default-sha256: 826e5341f98603955b3fb9d46989609c3f90949d5f8c6a125d194554c933f152
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had not performed the ⟪k:1⟫proper⟪k:2⟫ greeting.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Even in jest, he had no "
"business ⟪k:5⟫actually⟪k:6⟫ putting his lips on my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’avait pas fait ⟪k:1⟫correctement⟪k:2⟫ le salut.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Même pour plaisanter, il "
"n’avait absolument pas à poser ⟪k:5⟫vraiment⟪k:6⟫ ses lèvres sur ma main."

#: scenario7:scenario7_698A0752_EF9B_41D6_9EE7_5F5A9FC921B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e405df47c736487f9ea1254e6e1200e03e21a6de525963c6c688b5df912fb3a4
